Okay, okay, your father will remember.

102
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,890
Let's go.

103
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,650
Juniors of the Heng Yue Sect,

104
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:31,440
