Master...

117
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:11,800
And now, this old man has come to claim Heng Yue Mountain !

118
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,760
Everyone, stand your ground !

119
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,330
