161
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,770
Qi Scattering Grass

162
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:15,320
or Three Threadworm Grass ?

163
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,680
Since you already know,

164
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:22,210
