174
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,290
Yes !

175
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,960
Break !

176
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,520
Ancestor, focus on the formation.

177
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:19,640
