182
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:44,480
Huanglong, stop this madness !

183
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:47,880
Piao Nanzi ! As long as I, Huanglong, am here,

184
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,800
