186
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:58,450
Unaware of your limits ?

187
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,560
Huanglong !

188
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,120
Sect Leader ! Senior Brother !

189
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:17,120
This Huanglong brat

190
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:18,600
was nothing special.

191
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,520
The Heng Yue Sect raised me for 20 years.

192
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:31,840
Today, I will protect the Heng Yue Sect !

193
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:35,240
Today, we protect the Heng Yue Sect !

194
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:38,240
Today, we protect the Heng Yue Sect !

195
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:49,720
Piao Nanzi, as long as one Heng Yue disciple remains,

196
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:51,680
you won’t take Heng Yue Mountain !

197
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:54,650
Nonsense !

198
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:57,890
Break !

199
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:01,440
Don’t waste your energy.

200
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,280
You can't break this formation

201
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:05,520
