208
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:26,120
This saves me some trouble !

209
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:31,880
I advise you not to resist

210
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:35,640
or you won't even keep your consciousness.

211
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,570
Wang Lin !

212
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,450
Wang Lin !

213
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,890
Wang Lin, wake up !

214
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:47,560
Wake up, Wang Lin !

215
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:48,800
Wang Lin !

216
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,240
Wake up !

217
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,850
