229
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:33,570
It can also be used as a poison to control someone temporarily.

230
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,880
It's a good plant.

231
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,040
Just in case,

232
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:39,510
