269
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:34,850
Mountains near
Heng Yue Mountain

270
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:39,490
Both Wang Zhuo and I come from the Heng Yue Sect.

271
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:41,490
